<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-UTIHAD ALGIERS BEAT CHABAB BATNA 1-0 IN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UTIHAD ALGIERS BEAT CHABAB BATNA 1-0 IN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utihad Algiers won Algeria's soccer</p>
<p>cup final on Saturday when they beat Chabab Batna 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0).</p>
<p>Scorer: Tarek Ghoul 52</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000.</p>
</text>
